category: Libs
requires: libcoeurl0.3 libcurl-devel libevent-devel libspdlog-devel pkg-config
sdesc: "Simple async wrapper around CURL for C++ (development)"
ldesc: "Simple library to do http requests asynchronously via CURL in C++. (Eventually
as coroutines, once all the compilers I need to support support them.)"
external-source: coeurl

